# Serra Paragon: the once during each of your turns is shared between the land play and the cast. Faithless Looting discards
# Mishra's Workshop and Ornithopter. On turn 1 Bot1 casts the Ornithopter from the graveyard, and the Workshop then can't be
# played from there although the turn's land play is unused. On turn 3 it can (the control). Bot2 kills the Ornithopter with
# Lightning Bolt on turn 2: it is exiled instead of going to the graveyard, and Bot1 gains 2 life.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Faithless Looting
Serra Paragon
Plains
Plains
Mishra's Workshop
Ornithopter
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x20

